   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void Pwm_Notification_<#Channel> (void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>The Pwm module shall call the function Pwm_ Notification_<#Channel> accordingly to the last call of Pwm_ Enable Notification for channel <#Channel>.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
